{{right|''Swift'', Gulliver’s Travels, i. 8.}}}}
'''2.''' The bearer of a flag; a standard-bearer; an ensign.
{{smaller block|''Ancient'', let your colours fly; but have a great care of the butchers’ hooks at Whitechapel; they have been the death of many a fair ancient.
